    "body": "I've got all the tests done and passing except for 1. I can't get the repository into a renamed index/workdir state. Any tips if you've seen this status?\r\n\r\nI've tried `mv` and `git mv` with several additions of `git add` and `git commit`, both with no luck. My repo status comes back with `INDEX_NEW | INDEX_DELETED` and it shows the indicators for both of those statuses instead of a rename.\r\n\r\nEdit: I just figured it out, had to add a `StatusOption` to track renames.",
